    "name": "Artillery Tycoon",
    "steam_appid": 3370510,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>April Update</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have managed to build a Alpha version of the game that I'm aiming to release on April 30th!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that it's currently up for Steam review so the date might change and also please note that this is a Alpha version and there will be some bugs. I hope that you are willing to try the game and that you are able to see the potential in it as much as I can. I will keep you guys updated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that I also setup a Discord channel, this will be used later on when the game is released for bug reporting and also if anyone have any ideas or thoughts about the game. head over there now and join us while we wait.</p></p><br><h1>Second uodate!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm happy to let you guys know we are continuing to develop the game and in the last couple of weeks I have been working on mostly programming the different functions of the game but I have also updated the main screen and the factory screen to improve the feel for the game play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you haven't already please go and Wishlist the game. I'm a small game developer so wish listing\u00a0the game will show me your support! Thank you!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370510/extras/c89c257dbca5c835f32e7ce8be82804d.avif?t=1753495749\" data-has-big width=800 height=638 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370510/extras/1250eafb9ed2706dc6c6e500873905b5.avif?t=1753495749\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p></p><br><h1>March update</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have continued to work on the different features of the game to get the game closer to release and also updated the main screen for more details and updated the different stages for a few of the artillery pieces. We have much work ahead of us in March and hope we can get closer to a release before the summer! Please show your support and wish list<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370510/extras/1fcaa919e1c902db78a41ce48a127ce1.avif?t=1753495749\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370510/extras/3bdf1f80f20110bb60a803e9ec3f2447.avif?t=1753495749\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370510/extras/162cb5c001d3450778b03184932538a6.avif?t=1753495749\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> the game and keep following us for\u00a0 ore updates. If you have any questions or ideas just let me know! Thanks!</p></p><br><h1>Roadmap!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I saw a post where it was suggested this is a scam game due to lack of information and and road map. So let me present to you what the road map and future updates will look like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm aiming to do a major update roughly every 3 months, how ever now int he beginning there will probably be more smaller updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several mechanics that will be included in the game in the future:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Office, you'll need to manage employees, hire and fire engineers and workers and manage your buildings</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battel notifications, there will be detailed reviews of how the artillery behaves in battles and how effective they are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world map to let you know where they are being used</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved graphics, this will be a ongoing process and I will try to improve sections as we go along, the first step is to incorporate the mechanics then make sure they look nice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooting range, will add manual aiming and also add a 5 shot series so you get get a average of how your gun is performing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More guns! I aim to always add a few more pieces of artillery for every major update, the first ones should be added in roughly a week</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound, yes it gets pretty quiet playing sometimes so I want to have some sounds included in the next update</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >News, we need to know what's going on in the world and who's fighting with who</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shipping, right now UPS comes and picks up and ships your artillery pieces for free, but that's not going to last forever, a shipping and logistics function will also be added</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are some of the major items that will be added as we go along. I'm also very interested in any suggestions you players might have and if you feel there is anything missing or that should be added.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Update!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everybody!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is finally a update for the game that I hope will bring you more game time and some new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are some of the updates:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two new pieces of artillery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370510/extras/2b685fce0be8faa89e210ecddc1571cc.avif?t=1753495749\" width=670 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feldhaubitz 14</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370510/extras/dd26f35a104dbaa1128745cccbd340d1.avif?t=1753495749\" width=710 height=476 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >British 18-pounder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loan function\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have added some sound to a few locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possibility to skip the tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is now a 5-shot series in the shooting range that will give you a average of it's accuracy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increased game speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed several small bugs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>July Update</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hello everybody and thank you for the continued support!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I just wanted to share some more information on when the next update should be expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's my ambition to start work on the next update in 4-6 weeks and I hope that I can release it within 10-12 weeks.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work will continue to add more mechanics to the game and once work has started I will let you know what the next update will contain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you again for your patience and I hope you have a great summer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370510/extras/7b8455d3b73a5882c85ae598888cc4eb.avif?t=1753495749\" width=1000 height=646 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artillery Tycoon puts you in charge of building and managing a growing artillery factory. Research advanced weapon designs, optimize production, and fulfill contracts for nations in need of heavy firepower. Test your creations on the shooting range to ensure peak performance and outclass the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your success hinges on balancing resources, innovation, and market strategy. Experiment with unique artillery designs, expand your operations, and establish your reputation as a leader in military manufacturing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you dominate the global market and reshape the future of warfare? Step into the world of Artillery Tycoon\u00a0and\u00a0find\u00a0out!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artillery Tycoon puts you in charge of building and managing a growing artillery factory. Research advanced weapon designs, optimize production, and fulfill contracts for nations in need of heavy firepower. Test your creations on the shooting range to ensure peak performance and outclass the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your success hinges on balancing resources, innovation, and market strategy. Experiment with unique artillery designs, expand your operations, and establish your reputation as a leader in military manufacturing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you dominate the global market and reshape the future of warfare? Step into the world of Artillery Tycoon\u00a0and\u00a0find\u00a0out!</p>",
    "short_description": "Take charge of a factory in the early 1900's and research and build artillery. Research new parts and combine them to create the ultimate artillery piece. Win the contracts from governments around the world, manage your factory and produce and ship on time!",
